  "description": "CalDAV (RFC 4791) and CardDAV (RFC 6352) for Shiny.Net.HttpServer — serve an app's calendars and contacts to iOS and macOS Calendar and Contacts, Thunderbird and DAVx⁵, without ASP.NET Core. Discovery, sync-collection, calendar and address book queries with recurrence-aware time ranges, and minimal iCalendar and vCard parsers; trim- and AOT-clean throughout.",
